sp_jwy","title":"王太后","surname":"樛","ming":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p006","references":[{"title":"〈南越列傳〉興立與王太后","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷113&oldid=8735632","quote":"太子興代立，其母為太后。太后自未為嬰齊姬時，嘗與霸陵人安國少季通。及嬰齊薨後，元鼎四年，漢使安國少季往諭王、王太后以入朝，比內諸侯；令辯士諫大夫終軍等宣其辭，勇士魏臣等輔其缺，衛尉路博德將兵屯桂陽，待使者。王年少，太後中國人也，嘗與安國少季通，其使復私焉。國人頗知之，多不附太后。太后恐亂起，亦欲倚漢威，數勸王及群臣求內屬。即因使者上書，請比內諸侯，三歲一朝，除邊關。於是天子許之，賜其丞相呂嘉銀印，及內史、中尉、太傅印，餘得自置。除其故黥劓刑，用漢法，比內諸侯。使者皆留填撫之。王、王太后飭治行裝重齎，為入朝具。","scope":"received_title_attestation","image_verified":false}],"note":"姓氏據邯鄲樛氏女，名未記；王太后據下一段明示太后。未把女字當名，未補父親或其餘孩子生母。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/113.json"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-shiji113-p009-3q4_zsp_jwy","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p009","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m009-0010","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/113.json"}],"interpretation_note":"攻殺太后承接樛氏女，未將元鼎四年使者來訪直接作死亡年。 不補死亡地點、葬地或全部官爵終點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"樛氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m006-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"樛氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:m007-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"3q4_zsp_jwy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue"}